If you don't already have protection, you will always get a first increase
of 2-4 points of armour class (*not* always 4 points). This increase is
random, and does not depend on current AC.
Note, however, that once you first recieve this blessing, your HProtection
flag is set, and will never be un-set, not even if you lose the
protection.

After that first increase, you'll get an automatic increase of one point
only until your natural AC is 1.

After that, the increase is random, indeed, with a one-in-currentAC chance
of gaining one more point.

At a natural AC of -10 (that is, after you've received 20 points from the
gods), you will no longer recieve any more AC this way.

